msgid "Compiling for iOS"
msgstr "為 iOS 編譯"

msgid ""
"This page describes how to compile iOS export template binaries from source. "
"If you're looking to export your project to iOS instead, "
"read :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."
msgstr ""
"本頁說明如何從原始碼編譯 iOS 匯出範本二進位檔。如果你想要將專案匯出到 iOS，請"
"參閱 :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`。"

msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系統需求"

msgid "`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/>`_."
msgstr "`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/>`_。"

msgid ""
"If using Python 3.9 to 3.13, also run ``pip install --user zstandard`` to "
"install Zstandard support for Python. This is not required on Python 3.14 "
"and above, which include Zstandard support by default."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Python 3.9 至 3.13，還須執行 ``pip install --user zstandard``，安裝 "
"Python 的 Zstandard 支援。Python 3.14 及更新版本已預設包含 Zstandard 支援，因"
"此不需要此步驟。"

msgid "`SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`_ build system."
msgstr "`SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`_ 建置系統。"

msgid "`Xcode <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/xcode/id497799835>`_."
msgstr "`Xcode <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/xcode/id497799835>`_。"

msgid ""
"Launch Xcode once and install iOS support. If you have already launched "
"Xcode and need to install iOS support, go to *Xcode -> Settings... -> "
"Platforms*."
msgstr ""
"請先啟動一次 Xcode 並安裝 iOS 支援。若已經啟動過 Xcode但需要安裝 iOS 支援，請"
"前往 *Xcode -> 設定... -> 平台*。"

msgid ""
"Go to *Xcode -> Settings... -> Locations -> Command Line Tools* and select "
"an installed version. Even if one is already selected, re-select it."
msgstr ""
"前往 *Xcode -> 設定... -> 位置 -> 命令列工具* 並選擇一個已安裝的版本。即使已"
"經有選擇，請重新選取一次。"

msgid ""
"Download and follow README instructions to build a static ``.xcframework`` "
"from the `MoltenVK SDK <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK#fetching-"
"moltenvk-source-code>`__."
msgstr ""
"下載並依照 README 說明，從 `MoltenVK SDK <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/"
"MoltenVK#fetching-moltenvk-source-code>`__ 建置靜態 ``.xcframework``。"

msgid ""
"If you have `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_ installed, you can easily install "
"SCons using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"若已安裝 `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_，可以用以下指令輕鬆安裝 SCons："

msgid ""
"Installing Homebrew will also fetch the Command Line Tools for Xcode "
"automatically if you don't have them already."
msgstr "安裝 Homebrew 時，若尚未安裝 Xcode 命令列工具，會自動下載安裝。"

msgid ""
"Similarly, if you have `MacPorts <https://www.macports.org/>`_ installed, "
"you can easily install SCons using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"同樣地，若已安裝 `MacPorts <https://www.macports.org/>`_，可使用以下指令安裝 "
"SCons："

msgid ""
"To get the Godot source code for compiling, see :ref:`doc_getting_source`."
msgstr "如需取得 Godot 編譯所需的原始碼，請參閱 :ref:`doc_getting_source`。"

msgid ""
"For a general overview of SCons usage for Godot, "
"see :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`."
msgstr ""
"關於 Godot 使用 SCons 的基本說明，請參"
"閱 :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`。"

msgid "Compiling"
msgstr "編譯"

msgid ""
"Open a Terminal, go to the root folder of the engine source code and type "
"the following to compile a debug build:"
msgstr "開啟終端機，前往引擎原始碼的根目錄，並輸入下列指令以編譯偵錯版本："

msgid "To compile a release build:"
msgstr "要編譯發行版本："

msgid ""
"To create an Xcode project like in the official builds, you need to use the "
"template located in ``misc/dist/apple_embedded_xcode``. The release and "
"debug libraries should be placed in ``libgodot.ios.debug.xcframework`` and "
"``libgodot.ios.release.xcframework`` respectively. Camera module libraries "
"should be placed in ``libgodot_camera.ios.debug.xcframework`` and "
"``libgodot_camera.ios.release.xcframework``. This process can be automated "
"by using the ``generate_bundle=yes`` option on the *last* SCons command used "
"to build export templates (so that all binaries can be included)."
msgstr ""
"要建立與官方建置版本相同的 Xcode 專案，需使用位於 ``misc/dist/"
"apple_embedded_xcode`` 目錄中的範本。Release 和 Debug 庫應分別放置在 "
"``libgodot.ios.debug.xcframework`` 和 ``libgodot.ios.release.xcframework`` 目"
"錄下；Camera 模組的庫應分別放置在 ``libgodot_camera.ios.debug.xcframework`` "
"和 ``libgodot_camera.ios.release.xcframework`` 目錄下。此過程可通過在用於建置"
"匯出範本的 *最後一個* SCons 命令中啟用 ``generate_bundle=yes`` 選項來實現自動"
"化（從而確保所有二進位檔案均被包含）。"

msgid ""
"The MoltenVK static ``.xcframework`` folder must also be placed in the "
"``apple_embedded_xcode`` folder once it has been created. MoltenVK is always "
"statically linked on iOS; there is no dynamic linking option available, "
"unlike macOS."
msgstr ""
"建立完成後，還需將 MoltenVK 的靜態 ``.xcframework`` 資料夾放置到 "
"``apple_embedded_xcode`` 資料夾中。MoltenVK 在 iOS 系統上始終採用靜態連結方"
"式；與 macOS 不同，iOS 平台不支援動態連結選項。"

msgid "The iOS simulator only supports the ``Compatibility`` renderer."
msgstr "iOS 模擬器僅支援 ``相容`` 渲染器。"

msgid ""
"Apple Silicon Macs can run iOS apps natively, so you can run exported iOS "
"projects directly on an Apple Silicon Mac without iOS simulator limitations."
msgstr ""
"搭載 Apple Silicon 芯片的 Mac 電腦可以原生執行 iOS 應用，因此你可以直接在 "
"Apple Silicon Mac 上執行匯出的 iOS 專案，而完全不受 iOS 模擬器的各種限制。"

msgid "Run"
msgstr "執行"

msgid ""
"To run on a device, follow these instructions: :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."
msgstr "如需在裝置上執行，請依照這些指示操作： :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`。"

msgid ""
"iOS exports can run directly on an Apple Silicon Mac. To run exported iOS "
"project on Mac, open exported project in Xcode and select ``My Mac`` in the "
"``Run Destinations`` dropdown."
msgstr ""
"匯出的 iOS 專案可直接在 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 上執行。要在 Mac 執行匯出的 iOS "
"專案，請在 Xcode 開啟匯出的專案，並在 ``Run Destinations`` 下拉選單中選擇 "
"``My Mac``。"

msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "疑難排解"

msgid "Fatal error: 'cstdint' file not found"
msgstr "致命錯誤：找不到 'cstdint' 檔案"

msgid ""
"If you get a compilation error of this form early on, it's likely because "
"the Xcode command line tools installation needs to be repaired after a macOS "
"or Xcode update:"
msgstr ""
"如果在一開始就遇到這類編譯錯誤，通常是因為在更新 macOS 或 Xcode 後，Xcode 命"
"令列工具需要修復："

msgid ""
"Run these two commands to reinstall Xcode command line tools (enter your "
"administrator password as needed):"
msgstr ""
"執行以下兩個指令以重新安裝 Xcode 命令列工具（需要時輸入系統管理員密碼）："

msgid ""
"If it still does not work, try updating Xcode from the Mac App Store and try "
"again."
msgstr "若仍無法解決，請從 Mac App Store 更新 Xcode 後再試一次。"
